摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Prompt enhancement plugin for the DeepSeek Harness web GUI: one-click rewrite of the composer draft into a structured prompt, with preview, fill-back, and undo.","id":"gh:1350342847","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-prompt-enhance","slug":"rongxingda/dsh-prompt-enhance","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","prompt-engineering"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Prompt enhancement plugin for the DeepSeek Harness web GUI: one-click rewrite of the composer draft "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"into a structured prompt, with preview, fill-back, and undo."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-prompt-enhance"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Prompt enhancement for the DeepSeek Harness web GUI** — one click turns a rough composer draft int"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"o a well-structured prompt: explicit role and goal, executable steps, output format, acceptance crit"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"eria, and edge cases. Your intent is never changed, nothing is fabricated, and the original draft is"},{"id":"p3s4","text":"es. Your intent is never changed, nothing is fabricated, and the original draft is always preserved."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Why"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Good agent prompts state *who the model should be*, *what to deliver*, *in what format*, and *how su"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ccess is judged*. Most drafts don't. This plugin adds a **WorkBuddy-style \"enhance\" affordance** to "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"the dsh composer: it sends your draft through a low-temperature rewrite pass (via the harness's own "},{"id":"p6s4","text":"LLM service), shows the result next to the original, and lets you apply, copy, or discard it. Undo i"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"s one click away, and every failure path leaves your draft exactly as you typed it."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| ✨ **Composer button** | A small button in the input box's tool row (next to the send button), alwa"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"ys at hand |\n| 🔀 **Preview panel** | Original vs. enhanced side by side, with model name and elapsed"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" time |\n| ↩️ **One-click undo** | After applying, a quiet bar above the composer restores the origin"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"al draft |\n| ⌨️ **Shortcut** | Default `Ctrl+Alt+E`, fully configurable, acts on the composer you ar"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"e working in |\n| 💬 **`/enhance` command** | Rewrite any text from the slash-command plane; the resul"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"t never enters model history |\n| 🧠 **Model routing** | Settings pair → current session model → harne"},{"id":"p8s7","text":"ss default model, in that order |\n| 🔑 **Zero credential setup** | Calls ride the harness LLM service"},{"id":"p8s8","text":"; keys come from the harness credential store |\n| ⚙️ **Live settings** | Every knob (model override,"},{"id":"p8s9","text":" temperature, budgets, system prompt, shortcut) hot-applies from Settings → 插件配置 |\n| 🛡️ **Draft safe"},{"id":"p8s10","text":"ty** | Empty, over-length, images-only, and command-chip inputs are rejected locally; upstream failu"},{"id":"p8s11","text":"res are mapped to readable messages; the draft is never mutated on failure |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The plugin is one npm package with two halves, following the dsh plugin conventions:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- `dsh >= 0.1.1-rc.2 < 0.3.0` — the range states what has actually been exercised, not an open-ended"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" promise.\n- Boot-verified on `0.1.1-rc.2`, `0.1.2-alpha.3`, `0.1.7-rc.2`, `0.2.0-rc.2`, `0.2.1-rc.2`"},{"id":"p14s3","text":", and **`0.2.1-rc.5`** (layer mounts, enhance route answers, client bundle builds; on alpha the plug"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"in takes the newer `ctx.settings.installSection` registration path, and on `0.2.0-rc.2` it also pass"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"es the runtime's plugin-compatibility gate). `0.2.1-rc.5` was checked by diffing every `@deepseek-ai"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"/dsh-*` package the plugin builds against: apart from `dsh-client-ui-conversation`, whose `lib/` gai"},{"id":"p14s7","text":"ned a View-tabs More menu and a `whenDraftExists` option on draft initialization, the published tree"},{"id":"p14s8","text":"s are **byte-identical** to `0.2.1-rc.2`, and none of the additions touch a contract this plugin use"},{"id":"p14s9","text":"s. On a temporary profile at `rc.5` the plugin composed into the loader tree, `/prompt-enhance/enhan"},{"id":"p14s10","text":"ce` answered with a real model result, `/enhance-stream` emitted live SSE deltas, and the host's own"},{"id":"p14s11","text":" schema dump showed the entry as `config100` with **every field carrying `x-cordis.volatile`** — 16 "},{"id":"p14s12","text":"of 16 on that run, 17 of 17 once `reasoningEffort` landed — the exact condition `SettingsForms.descr"},{"id":"p14s13","text":"ibe()` checks before it renders a page. The `0.2.1-rc.2` check is a **real-host end-to-end smoke**: "},{"id":"p14s14","text":"with the l [长行截断]\n- The ceiling covers the whole `0.2.x` line (including its prereleases); a `0.3.x`"},{"id":"p14s15","text":" is untested and therefore outside the range. `dsh.engines` **is enforced**: the host's boot preflig"},{"id":"p14s16","text":"ht marks a mismatched entry `disabled = true`, and only an explicit `--accept-risk` gets past the th"},{"id":"p14s17","text":"row (`Incompatible plugins may cause crashes or data loss`). A wrong range means the plugin does not"},{"id":"p14s18","text":" load — not that it loads with a warning.\n- Node `^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0` (for building from source)\n["},{"id":"p14s19","text":" not that it loads with a warning.\n- Node `^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0` (for building from source)\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Security model"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"The enhance route is served by your own dsh host and reachable **only from this machine**:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- **Socket fence** — requests from non-loopback addresses are refused (`127.0.0.1` / `::1` only). No"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"te this means *any local process* can call the route; it carries no user authentication.\n- **Host al"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"lowlist** — the route also validates the `Host` header against `localhost` / `127.0.0.1` / `[::1]`, "},{"id":"p17s4","text":"which defeats DNS-rebinding (a rebound attacker domain keeps the loopback socket address but carries"},{"id":"p17s5","text":" the attacker's hostname and is refused). Responses are `cache-control: no-store`.\n- **Abuse caps** "},{"id":"p17s6","text":"— an `Origin` gate refuses browser calls from non-local pages, and from pages served by *any other* "},{"id":"p17s7","text":"local port (the origin's port must equal the port the request was addressed to, so a dev tool on `lo"},{"id":"p17s8","text":"calhost:4000` cannot spend your model quota); the route enforces a concurrency cap (`maxConcurrent`,"},{"id":"p17s9","text":" default 2) and a per-minute rate limit (`rateLimitPerMinute`, default 10), answering `429` beyond e"},{"id":"p17s10","text":"ither. Both counters live **in a single host process's memory**: multiple processes, a cluster, or s"},{"id":"p17s11","text":"everal profiles mounting the plugin each count independently, so the global cap would be exceeded — "},{"id":"p17s12","text":"this plugin supports single-process deployments only and ships no shared rate-limit store.\n- **Proxy"},{"id":"p17s13","text":" rejection** — requests carrying `X-Forwarded-For` / `Forwarded` headers are refused outright: those"},{"id":"p17s14","text":" headers only exist when a proxy is in the path, which the trust model does not cover.\n- **Request-l"},{"id":"p17s15","text":"evel timeouts are the host's and Node's job** — the plugin bounds the body size (including a Content"},{"id":"p17s16","text":"-Length fast reject) and the per-call `timeoutMs`; connection-level timeouts (headers / request time"},{"id":"p17s17","text":"out / keep-alive) are server-level settings on the shared `http.Server` that a prefix route must not"},{"id":"p17s18","text":" touch, so they fall to the host and Node's defaults (60 s headers / 300 s request).\n- **Not for rev"},{"id":"p17s19","text":"erse-proxy exposure** — if you put dsh web behind a proxy that listens on the LAN, external callers "},{"id":"p17s20","text":"appear as loopback to the route and the fence is moot. Do not expose a proxied host without adding y"},{"id":"p17s21","text":"our own authentication at the proxy.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
